support to requeue a failed bio.

NVMe has almost like-for-like equivalents here:
    - nvme_available_path() -> mpath_available_path()
    - nvme_requeue_work() -> mpath_requeue_work()
    - nvme_ns_head_submit_bio() -> mpath_bdev_submit_bio()

